pent the night listening to moreporks. I could hear them calling long after the hut went quiet.</p></article>\n          <article class=\"mobile-diary-entry\"><time datetime=\"2025-05-13\"><b>13</b> May</time><p>Someone left homemade muffins at the trail shelter. That kindness carried me through the last wet kilometres.</p></article>\n          <article class=\"mobile-diary-entry\"><time datetime=\"2025-05-12\"><b>12</b> May</time><p>The rain finally stopped. The views today were worth every blister and every soaked sock.</p></article>\n          <article class=\"mobile-diary-entry\"><time datetime=\"2025-05-11\"><b>11</b> May</time><p>A family walked beside me and shared their own cancer journey. I carried their story all day.</p></article>\n          <article class=\"mobile-diary-entry\"><time datetime=\"2025-05-10\"><b>10</b> May</time><p>Slow going through the mud, but a bright patch of daffodils beside the road felt like a sign to keep moving.</p></article>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mobile-diary-controls\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-diary-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous diary entry\">\u2190</button>\n          <span><b data-diary-current=\"\">1</b> / 5</span>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-diary-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next diary entry\">\u2192</button>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"mobile-view mobile-detail mobile-detail--trail\" data-mobile-view=\"trail\" aria-labelledby=\"mobile-trail-title\" hidden=\"\">\n      <img class=\"mobile-detail-photo\" src=\"assets/images/hero.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n      <div class=\"mobile-detail-shade\"></div>\n      <button class=\"mobile-view-back\" type=\"button\" data-open-view=\"hub\" aria-label=\"Back to journey hub\">\u2190 <span>Journey</span></button>\n      <article class=\"mobile-trail-card\">\n        <span class=\"mobile-kicker\">Latest trail update</span>\n        <h2 id=\"mobile-trail-title\">Next stop</h2>\n        <div class=\"mobile-route\">\n          <div><small>Today</small><strong>Taihape</strong></div>\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>\n          <div><small>Tomorrow</small><strong>National Park</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <p>21 km walked today</p>\n        <div class=\"mobile-progress\" aria-label=\"Te Araroa progress\"><span></span></div>\n        <small>Cape Reinga <b>Te Araroa</b> Bluff</small>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"mobile-view mobile-detail mobile-detail--support\" data-mobile-view=\"support\" aria-labelledby=\"mobile-support-title\" hidden=\"\">\n      <img class=\"mobile-detail-photo\" src=\"assets/images/boots.jpg\" alt=\"Worn hiking boots with a yellow daffodil tucked into the laces\">\n      <div class=\"mobile-detail-shade\"></div>\n      <button class=\"mobile-view-back\" type=\"button\" data-open-view=\"hub\" aria-label=\"Back to journey hub\">\u2190 <span>Journey</span></button>\n      <article class=\"mobile-support-card\">\n        <span class=\"mobile-kicker\">Walk alongside K\u014dkiri</span>\n        <h2 id=\"mobile-support-title\">Make every<br>step count.</h2>\n        <p>Support the Cancer Society or send K\u014dkiri a note to read after a day on the trail.</p>\n        <a class=\"mobile-support-primary\" href=\"https://www.daffodilday.org.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support Daffodil Day <span>\u2197</span></a>\n        <a class=\"mobile-support-secondary\" href=\"mailto:kokiri_ontheroad@rkdb.nz?subject=A%20trail%20message%20for%20K%C5%8Dkiri\">Send a trail note <span>\u2192</span></a>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <main class=\"layout\">\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-label=\"K\u014dkiri on the Te Araroa Trail\">\n      <img src=\"assets/images/hero.jpg\" alt=\"K\u014dkiri looking towards mountains while hiking Te Araroa\">\n      <div class=\"hero-scrim\"></div>\n      <div class=\"hero-content\">\n        <h2 class=\"hero-title\">3,000<br>Kilometres</h2>\n        <p class=\"hero-sub\">One cause. Countless reasons to keep walking.</p>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-yellow\" href=\"https://www.daffodilday.org.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support Daffodil Day</a>\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span></span> Te Araroa \u2022 Cape Reinga to Bluff \u2022 2025</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"center-col\">\n      <section class=\"card card-about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-heading\">\n        <div class=\"about-portrait\">\n          <img src=\"assets/images/portrait.png\" alt=\"K\u014dkiri smiling directly at the camera in different trail clothing\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"about-text\">\n          <h2 id=\"about-heading\">Kia ora,<br>I'm K\u014dkiri.</h2>\n          <p>Cancer has touched my wh\u0101nau very personally. Over the last two years, both my koro and my auntie have faced cancer. I wanted to do something difficult enough to honour them and everyone walking that same road.</p>\n          <p>I'm walking Te Araroa from Cape Reinga to Bluff \u2014 3,000 kilometres, one day at a time. Along the way, I hope to <strong>whakapiki m\u014dhiotanga</strong> awareness of how deeply cancer affects Kiwi families, and encourage people to support the Cancer Society.</p>\n          <p>Every evening I update this website from my phone with where I've been, where I'm heading next, and a little story from the day. I read every message while I update the site, and it's something I genuinely look forward to.</p>\n          <p class=\"small-note\">Ng\u0101 mihi nui \u2014 thank you for walking alongside me.</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card journal-card\" aria-labelledby=\"journal-heading\">\n        <div class=\"journal-head\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"eyebrow\">Updated from the trail</span>\n            <h2 id=\"journal-heading\">On the Road with K\u014dkiri</h2>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"journal-edit-banner\">THIS SECTION IS YOURS TO FREELY EDIT</p>\n          <span class=\"journal-count\" aria-label=\"Five recent updates\">5</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"journal-list\">\n          <article class=\"journal-entry\">\n            <div class=\"journal-date\"><small>May</small><b>14</b></div>\n            <p>Spent the night listening to moreporks. I could hear them calling long after the hut went quiet.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"journal-entry\">\n            <div class=\"journal-date\"><small>May</small><b>13</b></div>\n            <p>Someone left homemade muffins at the trail shelter. That kindness carried me through the last wet kilometres.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"journal-entry\">\n            <div class=\"journal-date\"><small>May</small><b>12</b></div>\n            <p>The rain finally stopped. The views today were worth every blister and every soaked sock.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"journal-entry\">\n            <div class=\"journal-date\"><small>May</small><b>11</b></div>\n            <p>A family walked beside me and shared their own cancer journey. I carried their story all day.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"journal-entry\">\n            <div class=\"journal-date\"><small>May</small><b>10</b></div>\n            <p>Slow going through the mud, but a bright patch of daffodils beside the road felt like a sign to keep moving.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"journal-foot\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u25cf</span> K\u014dkiri updates daily from her phone.</div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <section class=\"card next-stop-card\" aria-labelledby=\"next-stop-heading\">\n        <div class=\"next-stop-head\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"eyebrow\">Latest trail update</span>\n            <h2 id=\"next-stop-heading\">Next stop</h2>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"editable-tag\">Editable</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"next-stop-route\">\n          <div><span>Today</span><strong>Taihape</strong></div>\n          <span class=\"route-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>\n          <div><span>Tomorrow</span><strong>National Park</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"next-stop-distance\">21 km walked today</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card message-card\" aria-labelledby=\"message-heading\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">A message for tonight</span>\n        <h2 id=\"message-heading\">Leave K\u014dkiri a trail note.</h2>\n        <p>After updating the journey from her phone each evening, K\u014dkiri sits down with a hot drink and reads the messages sent from here.</p>\n        <form id=\"message-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label><span>Your name</span><input id=\"sender-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required=\"\" style=\"\"></label>\n            <label><span>Email address</span><input id=\"sender-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required=\"\" style=\"\"></label>\n          </div>\n          <label><span>Your message</span><textarea id=\"sender-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Write your message to K\u014dkiri\u2026\" required=\"\" style=\"\"></textarea></label>\n          <button type=\"submit\">Send trail note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span></button>\n          <p id=\"form-status\" class=\"form-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card boots-card\" aria-label=\"Worn hiking boots with a daffodil\">\n        <img src=\"assets/images/boots.jpg\" alt=\"Worn hiking boots with a yellow daffodil tucked into the laces\">\n        <div class=\"boots-scrim\"></div>\n        <div class=\"boots-copy\">\n          <p>Tomorrow starts here.</p>\n          <span>Muddy boots. Another day closer to Bluff.</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"mobile-foot\" aria-label=\"Current campaign notice\">\n    <div class=\"mobile-foot-track\">\n      <span>Walking Te Araroa for the Cancer Society</span><b>On the Road</b><i>Next stop: National Park</i>\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">Walking Te Araroa for the Cancer Society</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">On the Road</b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">Next stop: National Park</i>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n  <script src=\"script.js?v=tablab-contact-20261006\"></script>\n\n\n</body>",
